  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:28.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:28.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">因南区15号楼综合维修改造项目施工需要，计划于6月6日至10日</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">8:30-11:30</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">，14:00-17:00</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">，占用至善路南区15号楼与宁斋交口至学堂路交口减速带路段半幅道路进行楼体外立面修复曲臂车占道施工。（具体详见附图）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:28.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:28.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:black\">为保障安全，在此期间该路段将采取锥桶、警戒带、专人盯控疏导管理措施，请来往行人、车辆避开封闭区域绕行,注意安全。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:28.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:28.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:black\">因作业施工给师生员工工作、学习造成不便深表歉意，感谢大家的理解配合！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify; text-indent:28.0pt\"> </p> \n <p style=\"margin-right:105px; margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:.15pt\">作业施工单位项目联系人：关宁  </span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">18515969407</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"margin-right:105px; margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">作业施工单位现场负责人：</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:.75pt\">肖飞  </span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">17610256862</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"margin-right:105px; margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">基建规划处联系人：徐老师 62782034 </span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"margin-right:105px; margin-left:43px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">保卫处交通办：62782602</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"margin-right:105px; margin-left:43px\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:black\">附现场示意图：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <div class=\"ckeditor-html5-img\" id=\"img1780624418309div\" style=\"text-align:center\"> \n  <img src=\"/b/ckeditor/downloadFiles?wjid=268_XXFB-FG_2026_LM_BM_268_BGTZ_178062425424460999e8e7e-82eb-4cba-8126-1cd7ad76bb93&dxid=LM_BM_268_BGTZ\" width=\"500\">  \n </div> \n <p></p> \n <p style=\"margin-right:105px; margin-left:43px\"> </p> \n <p style=\"margin-right: 105px; margin-left: 43px; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">基建规划处</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"margin-right: 105px; margin-left: 43px; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">保 卫 处</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"margin-right: 105px; margin-left: 43px; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">2026年6月5日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p> \n <p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 31px; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt\"><span style=\"line-height:178%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">                                                        </span></span></span></span></p> \n</div>",
  "contentText": "因南区15号楼综合维修改造项目施工需要，计划于6月6日至10日 8:30-11:30 ，14:00-17:00 ，占用至善路南区15号楼与宁斋交口至学堂路交口减速带路段半幅道路进行楼体外立面修复曲臂车占道施工。（具体详见附图） 为保障安全，在此期间该路段将采取锥桶、警戒带、专人盯控疏导管理措施，请来往行人、车辆避开封闭区域绕行,注意安全。 因作业施工给师生员工工作、学习造成不便深表歉意，感谢大家的理解配合！ 作业施工单位项目联系人：关宁 18515969407 作业施工单位现场负责人： 肖飞 17610256862 基建规划处联系人：徐老师 62782034 保卫处交通办：62782602 附现场示意图： 基建规划处 保 卫 处 2026年6月5日",
